SUMMARY:Winona Horticultural Society Gardeners Cafe and Plant Exchange
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the 20th May for our first Gardeners Cafe. This is an evening of socializing\, sharing our garden wins and fails\, plans for the summer. Bring along pictures from last year to share.There’s also a Plant Exchange\, bring any spare plants you have\, if you have none\, we’ll give you some to take away.Always free\, everyone is welcome\, accessible entrance.Wednesday 20th May 7:30pm \nSt. John’s Anglican Church Hall 1285 Hwy 8 (at Winona Road) Winona\, ON L8E 5R1
